From: RG35XX Java Platform
Task: RGJ-RC1-011CG / RGJ-RC1-011CH / RGJ-RC1-011CI / RGJ-RC1-011CJ
Subject: [PATCH] RG35XX: media pump, audio default, metric text and video hot-path cache

CJ keeps the validated media lifecycle and text path while removing two costly
hot-path allocations/conversions on RG35XX. The native RGB565 conversion buffer
is cached across retro_run() calls and invalidated only when a new Java frame or
software pointer changes pixels. The Java bitmap glyph helper separately removes
per-glyph int[7] allocations in the project source.

